OL,3,GNEWSANew hope for women with
OL,4,Aendometriosis symptoms
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's just this one thing that's
OL,7,Fholding me back," says Freya Baxter as
OL,8,Fshe speaks about endometriosis.
OL,10,FThe 22-year-old first went to her
OL,11,Fdoctor about her symptoms a decade ago,
OL,12,Fbut only recently received a diagnosis
OL,13,Fof stage 4 endometriosis, adenomyosis
OL,14,Fand aggressive polycystic ovary
OL,15,Fsyndrome.
OL,17,FEndometriosis - which affects one in 10
OL,18,Fwomen in the UK - is when tissue
OL,19,Fsimilar to the lining of the womb grows
OL,20,Foutside of it.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
