OL,3,GNEWSANew hope for women with
OL,4,Aendometriosis symptoms
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreya, from Chilwell in
OL,7,FNottinghamshire, believes it is
OL,8,Fimportant women get diagnosed sooner
OL,9,Fand has welcomed new specialist scans
OL,10,Fdesigned to help speed up diagnosis at
OL,11,Fthe Queen's Medical Centre (QMC) in
OL,12,FNottingham.
